{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sitoo/auth/pulls/146","id":3650937319,"node_id":"PR_kwDOMVV9rs7ZnOHn","html_url":"https://github.com/sitoo/auth/pull/146","diff_url":"https://github.com/sitoo/auth/pull/146.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sitoo/auth/pull/146.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sitoo/auth/issues/146","number":146,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(scim): route role/stores through IAM API when ROLESV2 set","user":{"login":"jacob-sitoo","id":178873884,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqlmHA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178873884?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-sitoo","html_url":"https://github.com/jacob-sitoo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-sitoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-sitoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-sitoo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-sitoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-sitoo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-sitoo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-sitoo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-sitoo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacob-sitoo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n  - Adds inline ROLESV2 branch to all 5 SCIM endpoints in `service/scim.go` (Create/Get/GetUsers/Update/Delete). When per-account `rolesv2` config var is set, role + stores read/write through new IAM\r\n  API instead of MySQL priv rows.\r\n  - New packages `provider/iam` (Client interface, in-memory mock, HTTP impl) and `provider/entitymgmt` (mock OrgID lookup; real impl deferred).\r\n  - Forwards inbound Basic Authorization to IAM via request context middleware.\r\n  - 4 CloudWatch log-filter alarms: `iam_error`, `iam_invariant_violation`, `entity_mgmt_error`, `rolesv2_dual_state`.\r\n\r\n  ## Behavior\r\n\r\n  ROLESV2 off (default): unchanged. MySQL priv rows authoritative.\r\n\r\n  ROLESV2 on:\r\n  - **Create**: MySQL profile only (skip role) + IAM `replaceSiteAssignment`. IAM failure after MySQL success → log `iam_error` + 500 (best-effort, no compensating delete).\r\n  - **Read** (`GetUser`/`GetUsers`): filter out users with no IAM assignment at site; iam-source wins over legacy with warn log on multi-iam or mixed.\r\n  - **Update**: always-replace at site — read existing → merge role+stores with patch → delete iam-source → create new. Stores-only PATCH with no existing role → 400 invalidSyntax.\r\n  - **Delete**: delete IAM site assignments, then check account-scope; if no other assignments → delete MySQL user row.\r\n\r\n  Single assignment per `(user, site)` enforced service-side. Scope on writes always sets `account_ids=[accountId]` and `site_ids=[siteId]`. Sandbox vs production env derived per-account from\r\n  `systemManager.GetSystemNodeId` (nodeID 900 → sandbox, else production).\r\n\r\n  ## Configuration\r\n\r\n  | Setting | Default | Notes |\r\n  |---|---|---|\r\n  | `rolesv2` (per-account) | `false` | Per-account `systemManager.GetConfigVars` toggle. |\r\n  | `CONFIG_IAM_CLIENT_MODE` | `mock` | Set `http` for production. |\r\n  | `CONFIG_IAM_API_BASE_URL` | (unset) | Required when mode=http. Prod `https://iam.sitooapis.com/v1`, test `https://iam.sitooapis-test.com/v1`. |\r\n  | `CONFIG_ENTITY_MGMT_CLIENT_MODE` | `mock` | Real impl deferred. |\r\n\r\n  ## Test plan\r\n  - [x] `go test ./...` passes\r\n  - [x] `make lint` clean\r\n  - [x] `make test` passes against real MySQL + Localstack\r\n  - [ ] Local smoke: `CONFIG_IAM_CLIENT_MODE=mock` + per-account `rolesv2=true`; verify SCIM Create/Get/Update/Delete round-trip role + stores via mock IAM and that user filter-out works at unassigned\r\n   sites\r\n  - [ ] Confirm legacy behavior unchanged on accounts without `rolesv2` set\r\n  - [ ] Verify forwarded Basic Authorization reaches IAM mock (e.g. with `CONFIG_IAM_CLIENT_MODE=http` + httptest server)\r\n\r\n  ## Open / follow-ups\r\n  - Real Entity Management API integration (currently mocked deterministic UUID per account).\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n- ROLESV2 will not be set on any account before IAM has been released to the environment.\r\n\r\n  🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-05-08T16:50:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T07:10:54Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"52372be444cc053ad9e98f060f3bafa9ce191c12","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"nalakamm","id":247131863,"node_id":"U_kgDODrru1w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247131863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nalakamm","html_url":"https://github.com/nalakamm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nalakamm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nalakamm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nalakamm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nalakamm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nalakamm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nalakamm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nalakamm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nalakamm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nalakamm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sitoo/auth/pulls/146/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sitoo/auth/pulls/146/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sitoo/auth/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sitoo/auth/issues/146/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sitoo/auth/statu